      "segment_id": "seg_001",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "大家好！今天我们来聊一篇关于卫星动量轮故障诊断的论文，题目是《基于改进自监督PatchTST框架的卫星动量轮故障诊断》。我们请到了论文作者之一来为我们解读。",
      "duration_seconds": 15.91,
      "start_seconds": 0,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_001"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_002",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "谢谢主持人。这篇论文来自西北工业大学自动化学院，主要解决在故障样本极少的情况下，如何准确诊断卫星动量轮的故障。",
      "duration_seconds": 11.28,
      "start_seconds": 15.91,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_002",
        "ev_003"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_003",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "为什么动量轮的故障诊断这么难呢？",
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "start_seconds": 27.19,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_005",
        "ev_006"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_004",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "动量轮是卫星姿态控制的核心执行机构，长期在真空、辐射和热应力下高速运转，轴承、电机绕组等部件容易退化。但故障数据极其有限，而且故障类别呈现长尾分布，少数常见故障占主导，很多罕见但重要的故障只有少量样本。",
      "duration_seconds": 21.26,
      "start_seconds": 30.65,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_005",
        "ev_006"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_005",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "那传统方法有哪些不足呢？",
      "duration_seconds": 3,
      "start_seconds": 51.91,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_007",
        "ev_009"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_006",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "早期基于模型的方法虽然物理可解释性强，但需要精确的数学模型，在轨参数漂移时效果下降。数据驱动方法如LSTM、TCN和Transformer等监督学习模型，依赖大量标注数据，在样本不平衡时性能会显著降低。",
      "duration_seconds": 19.37,
      "start_seconds": 54.91,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_007",
        "ev_009"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_007",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "所以这篇论文提出了一个自监督的PatchTST框架？能简要介绍一下吗？",
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "start_seconds": 74.28,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_003",
        "ev_012"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_008",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "是的。框架首先在健康数据上进行掩码自监督预训练，然后把PatchTST主干适配成窗口级故障分类器，并采用细粒度和粗粒度监督。整个框架集成了健康数据自监督预训练、PatchTST分类适配和长尾感知微调。",
      "duration_seconds": 19.32,
      "start_seconds": 81.41,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_003",
        "ev_012"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_009",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "预训练具体是怎么做的？",
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "start_seconds": 100.73,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_013",
        "ev_036"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_010",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "他们在大规模健康运行数据窗口上进行掩码重构预训练，掩码比例是60%。PatchTST编码器处理掩码后的多通道时间序列窗口，学习重构被掩码的片段。预训练后，编码器参数作为下游分类任务的初始化。",
      "duration_seconds": 19.15,
      "start_seconds": 103.18,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_013",
        "ev_036"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_011",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "这种自监督初始化带来了多大的性能提升？",
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "start_seconds": 122.33,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_013"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_012",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "在时间协议下，自监督初始化带来了最大+5.85个百分点的性能提升，准确率达到95.38%。",
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "start_seconds": 126.43,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_013"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_013",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "长尾分布问题是怎么处理的？",
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "start_seconds": 135.79,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_038",
        "ev_039",
        "ev_040"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_014",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "在微调阶段，他们采用了三种策略。首先，用Focal Loss替代标准交叉熵损失，Focal Loss通过聚焦参数γ降低易分类样本的权重，并引入类别权重αk来缓解类别不平衡。",
      "duration_seconds": 16.73,
      "start_seconds": 138.86,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_038",
        "ev_039",
        "ev_040"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_015",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "实验用了什么数据？评估指标有哪些？",
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "start_seconds": 155.59,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_027",
        "ev_015"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_016",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "text": "实验使用秦岭二号卫星动量轮系统的真实在轨遥测数据，包括转速、电流、温度等通道，窗口长度为512，共20个故障类别。除了总体准确率，还报告了宏平均精确率、召回率、F1分数以及每个类别的统计量，以全面评估长尾场景下的性能。",
      "duration_seconds": 22.06,
      "start_seconds": 159.84,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_027",
        "ev_015"
      ],
      "claim_type": "paper_fact"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "seg_017",
      "speaker": "host",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "text": "最后，请总结一下这篇论文的主要贡献。",
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "start_seconds": 181.9,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev_012",
